# Joined Researchers // Secret Rendezvous (CR 722). It does not enter prepared: "At the beginning of each end step, if an
# opponent has more cards in hand than you, this creature becomes prepared." At Bot1's end step on turn one Bot1 holds 4
# cards and Bot2 seven, so it becomes prepared. On turn three Secret Rendezvous - "You and target opponent each draw three
# cards" - gives both three: Bot1 5 - 1 + 3 = 7 cards, Bot2 7 + 3 = 10 (it discarded the eighth at turn two's cleanup).

[Bot1 Deck]
Joined Researchers
Mox Pearl x3
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Joined Researchers.Cast
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Joined Researchers.Prepared = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Joined Researchers.Prepared = true
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#3.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Secret Rendezvous.Cast(Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Hand.Count = 10
Bot1.Battlefield.Joined Researchers.Prepared = (absent)
